<title>MEXICO: Grupo Modelo corrects 1996, 1995 EPS.</title>
<headline>Grupo Modelo corrects 1996, 1995 EPS.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican beer giant Grupo Modelo on Tuesday corrected its 1996 and 1995 earnings per share and diluted earnings per share data reported last week, saying they were wrong due to an &quot;involuntary error&quot;.</p>
<p>It corrected 1996 EPS to 1.57 pesos from 1.54 and 1995 EPS to 1.29 pesos from 1.31. It changed diluted earnings per share to 1.54 pesos in 1996 from 1.57, and in 1995 to 1.31 pesos from 1.29.</p>
<p>((-- Henry Tricks, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9560))</p>
